hadiths[57]{hadithnumber,text}:
"758","'A'isha said"
"759","Ibn Mas'ud said"
"760","Abu'l-Haytham said"
"761","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"762","'Abdullah ibn Burayda reported from his father that the Messenger\nof Allah"
"763","'Adi ibn Arta' said"
"764","Abu Qilaba reported that 'Abdullah said to Abu Mas'ud - or\nAbu Mas'ud said to 'Abdullah"
"765","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr said"
"766","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"767","Ibn Abbas said"
"768","Ibn al-Kawwa' asked 'Ali about the Milky Way. He said"
"769","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"770","Abu'l-Harith al-Kirmani heard a man say to Abu Raja'"
"771","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"772","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"773","Mujahid said"
"774","Anas reported that the Prophet"
"775","Al-Miswar ibn Rifa'a al-Quruzi said"
"776","Jabir said"
"777","Bashir ibn Ma'bad as-Sadusi (whose name was Zahim ibn Ma'bad) made\nhijra (emigration) to the Prophet"
"778","Muhammad ibn Hilal reported that he saw the rooms of the wives\nof the Prophet"
"779","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"780","Abu Hurayra said"
"781","'Abdullah said"
"782","Abu 'Izza Yassar ibn 'Abdullah al-Hudhali reported that the Prophet"
"783","Abu 'Abdu'l-'Aziz said"
"784","after you\nhave said"
"785","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"786","'Abdullah ibn Dinar said"
"787","Anas ibn Malik heard the Messenger of Allah"
"788","Ibn 'Abbas said about """"There are some people who trade in distracting\ntales"""" (31:5) that it means singing and things like it."""""
"789","Al-Bara' ibn 'Azib reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"790","Fadala ibn 'Ubayd was at a meeting when he heard that some people\nwere playing backgammon. He got up in anger to forbid it in the strongest\npossible terms. Then he said"
"791","Ibn Mas'ud was heard to say"
"792","Abu't-Tufayl said"
"793","Ibn 'Abbas reported that the Prophet"
"794","It is related that 'Ikrima said"
"795","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"796","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"797","'Alqama ibn Wa'il reported that the Prophet"
"798","See 772."
"799","Hamna bint Jahsh said"
"800","Habib ibn Sabhan al-Asadi said"
"801","Ash-Sharid said"
"802","'A'isha said"
"803","Anas ibn Malik said"
"804","As-Sa'b ibn Hakim reported that his grandfather said"
"805","Abu Dharr said"
"806","'Abdullah ibn Shaddad said"
"807","'Abdullah ibn Burayda related that his father said"
"808","As-Sa'b ibn Hakim reported that his grandfather said"
"809","Anas said"
"810","Ibn Abi Sa'sa'sa reported from his father that Abu Sa'id al-Khudri\ncalled him """"my son""""."""""
"811","'A'isha reported that the Prophet"
"812","Same with another isnad."
"813","Hani' ibn Yazid related that when he came to the Prophet"
"814","'Abdullah Hudud related that the Prophet"
